		<description>A unique weapon built on the iceworld of Vasilevsky. On this brutal world the forces of the Crimson Guard, a army of revolutionary soldiers in service to the state have fought against the Omega Hivefleet. Vasilevsky is not a kind world, a frozen wasteland barring the habitable ring on the worlds equator which makes up the Great City of Vasilygrad. Vasilevsky was one of the few worlds to rebel and become independent of the Great Domain, however their freedom shortlived as only a few centuries later they would come under the threat of the insectoids. This weapon was their solution, rather than a conventional blade, using a chainsaw as a base to carve through chitin and guts, gaining it popularity with its brutality.\n\nOfficial Name: Vasilevsky MV-12 "Chainsword."</description>
